QuestGuidance.Register("en",458,{
[14625]="70036B3F\n1\tSpeak with Ransroth\tYou should speak with Ransroth to continue.\n",
[14626]="7003E16C\n1\tSpeak with Ransroth\tYou should speak with Ransroth to continue.\n",
[14627]="7003E16B\n1\tSpeak with Ransroth\tYou should speak with Ransroth to continue.\n",
[14628]="7003E16D\n1\tSpeak with Ransroth\tYou should speak with Ransroth to continue.\n",
[14629]="70035A9E\n1\tSpeak with Harding about Wildermore\tHarding has summoned you to Harwick to begin an investigation of Wildermore, the lands to the north-west of the Wold. You should speak with Harding at the Mead Hall of Harwick.\n2\tSpeak with Harding about Wildermore\tHarding has summoned you to Harwick to begin an investigation of Wildermore, the lands to the north-west of the Wold. You should speak with Harding at the Mead Hall of Harwick.\n",
[14630]="700357E7\n1\tComplete quests to assist Wildermore (total: 5)\tQuest listings can be found posted throughout the centre of Forlaw. You should check the listings and select the five quests you'd like to complete in order to fulfill this task.\n",
[14631]="700604AA\n1\tDefeat any foes in the Angle that might threaten the safety of Ravaedron's friends (total: 8)\tThreatening beasts and other foes stalk the wilderness of Mitheithel, and Ravaedron wants you to thin their numbers for the sake of his friends.\n2\tRavaedron asked to meet you outside Glynafon, the ancestral home of the Stôrs, when you finished with your task.\t\n3\tFind the home of Meredud and Aderyn\030Find the home of Wenna\tConsumed by his memories of a bustling Glynafon, Ravaedron has asked you to look upon the places he remembers.\n4\tExamine the warg tracks in Glynafon\tYou have found warg tracks in Glynafon, an unwelcome but unsurprising discovery.\n5\tTalk to Ravaedron in Glynafon\tAccording to the tracks you discovered, a large number of wargs passed through Glynafon in recent days.\n6\tDefeat wargs or wolves in Glynafon or elsewhere in the Angle (total: 6)\tRavaedron has asked you to defeat any wargs you may find in the Angle, the better to ensure the safety of his friends Maddoc and Glenys Stagshorn, and that of travellers in Mitheithel.\n7\tMeet up with Ravaedron at Tornhad, the Ranger settlement on the banks of the Hoarwell, to the west\tRavaedron has suggested that the two of you meet up at Tornhad, the Ranger settlement in Mitheithel, to alert them to the danger posed by the wargs.\n8\tTalk to Ravaedron at Tornhad\tRavaedron has come to Tornhad, the Ranger settlement in the Angle.\n",
[14632]="7006B716\n1\tDefeat fallow deer (total: 4)\tShanthar has requested you slay some of the deer in Arwáth to restore balance to the population.\n2\tTalk to Shanthar\tYou have slain deer in Arwáth. You should return to Shanthar.\n",
[14633]="7005A14E\n1\tTalk to Rock\tBy completing this quest, you will receive a Wildwood currency allowance.\n",
[14634]="7005949A\n1\tCollect Wildwood croakers (total: 10)\tWildwood croakers can be found in watery locales in central Wildwood. Collect frog legs from Wildwood croakers.\n2\tTalk to Minda Heathertoes\tMinda can be found near a pond in the central Wildwood. You should talk to Minda Heathertoes.\n",
[14635]="7004A8D4\n1\tReport to Belzagar in the Tower of Cirith Ungol\tBelzagar can be found in the turret of the Tower of Cirith Ungol. Captain Róglarg has ordered you to report to Belzagar in the Tower of Cirith Ungol. The emissary of the Pale Herald is curious to learn how you escaped the fall of the Towers of the Teeth.\n2\tReport to Captain Róglarg in Cirith Ungol\tCaptain Róglarg can be found in the courtyard of Cirith Ungol. Belzagar has informed you that Captain Róglarg and his garrison are forbidden from abandoning Cirith Ungol.\n",
[14636]="7005AD94\n1\tTalk to King Thorin at Vosh Torú\tKing Thorin can be found at Vosh Torú. You have come with King Thorin on an errand to Vosh Torú. You should talk to King Thorin.\n2\tTalk to Hersegg at Vosh Torú\tHersegg can be found at Vosh Torú. After arriving at Vosh Torú, you have learned that Hersegg's errand involves her grandather, Hermáth. You should talk to Hersegg.\n3\tWait for Hersegg\tHersegg can be found at Vosh Torú. You should wait for Hersegg.\n4\tFollow King Thorin and meet Hermáth Stormhammer\tKing Thorin can be found at Vosh Torú. Hersegg has told you to come and speak with her grandfather. You should follow King Thorin and meet Hermáth Stormhammer.\n5\tMeet Hermáth Stormhammer\tHermáth Stormhammer can be found at Vosh Torú. You have entered Vosh Torú and found Hermáth Stormhammer. You should meet Hermáth Stormhammer.\n6\tHail Hermáth Stormhammer and introduce yourself\tHermáth Stormhammer can be found at Vosh Torú. You have met Hermáth Stormhammer and he seems eager to meet you in turn. You should hail Hermáth Stormhammer and introduce yourself.\n7\tTalk to King Thorin at Vosh Torú\tKing Thorin can be found at Vosh Torú. After introducing yourself, King Thorin has gestured for you to come speak with him. You should talk to King Thorin.\n8\tListen to King Thorin and Hermáth Stormhammer\tKing Thorin and Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Vosh Torú. After introducing yourself, King Thorin has asked to speak with Hermáth Stormhammer. You should listen.\n9\tTalk to King Thorin at Vosh Torú\tKing Thorin can be found at Vosh Torú. After speaking with Hermáth Stormhammer, King Thorin seems relieved. You should talk to King Thorin.\n",
[14637]="700431B5\n1\tTalk to Ketill Map-maker at Tharâkh Bazân, along Durin's Way\tKetill Map-maker said he would meet you in Tharâkh Bazân, along Durin's Way, to the north-east of the Dolven-view.\n2\tFind Willem Whisker somewhere in Tharâkh Bazân\tA large lynx ran by Ketill Map-maker in Tharâkh Bazân, heading to the east. Could it be Willem Whisker?\n3\tBring the wet page to Spalvi at the pool in Tharâkh Bazân\tSpalvi Stout-heart has come to the pool in Tharâkh Bazân. Willem Whisker found a page from Bingo's manuscript and you should show it to Spalvi.\n4\tFollow Willem Whisker east to the Stone Hall of Jazârgund\tWillem Whisker has run east from Tharâkh Bazân on the trail of some scent. Has he found Bingo's trail?\n5\tTalk to Spalvi at the Stone Hall of Jazârgund\tSpalvi is at the Stone Hall of Jazârgund, halfway along Durin's Way, in Moria.\n6\tFollow Willem Whisker east to the Fanged Pit\tWillem Whisker has run east from the Stone Hall of Jazârgund on the trail of some scent. Has he found Bingo's trail?\n7\tTalk to Spalvi at the Fanged Pit\tSpalvi has come to the Fanged Pit. Unlike Willem Whisker, he's not here to take a nap!\n8\tDefeat merrevail on your way to the pool of Khulturg, in the Fanged Pit\tMerrevail can be found in the Fanged Pit at the eastern end of Durin's Way, and they gather near pools of water such as the pool of Khulturg. Spalvi thinks you should make your way to the pool of Khulturg in the Fanged Pit, defeating merrevail to prove to the dwarves that you are a helpful sort.\n9\tTalk to Bingo by the side of the pool of Khulturg, in the Fanged Pit\tBingo sits by the edge of the pool of Khulturg, in the Fanged Pit, but something does not seem quite right.\n10\tTalk to Spalvi at the Fanged Pit\tSpalvi Stout-heart is in the camp of dwarves at the Fanged Pit. You have found Bingo Boffin, but it seems that he lost his memory during his time apart!\n",
[14638]="70044AB6\n1\tTalk to Willem Whisker inside the Grimslade Mead Hall\tWillem Whisker is inside the Grimslade Mead Hall, in the Westfold.\n2\tTalk to Bingo inside the Grimslade Mead Hall\tBingo is inside the Grimslade Mead Hall, in the Westfold. To Bingo's surprise, Willem has suddenly run outside!\n3\tFollow Willem Whisker\tYou have followed Willem through the Gap of Rohan and to the entrance of the Dunbog. Now the lynx has stopped, and he seems to be waiting for you.\n4\tTalk to Willem Whisker outside the Dunbog\tYou have followed Willem Whisker to the entrance to the Dunbog, where he has stopped and waited for you to catch up.\n5\tFollow Willem Whisker to the west, into the Dunbog\tWillem ran to the west, into the Dunbog.\n6\tTalk to Willem Whisker by the lonely tree in the Dunbog\tWillem Whisker has found a group of lynx in the north-east corner of the Dunbog, and many of them share his pattern and colour. Is this his family?\n7\tTalk to Bingo by the lonely tree in the Dunbog\tBingo is by the lonely tree in the north-east corner of the Dunbog, with Willem's family.\n8\tDefeat Orc abominations in the Dunbog (total: 4)\030Collect toad-meat from adult bog-toads in the Dunbog (total: 8)\030Collect suitable stones in the north-east corner of the Dunbog (total: 8)\tBingo wants you to help make the Dunbog the perfect home for Willem and his family. You should defeat Orc abominations in the north-west of the Dunbog, collect meat from toads throughout the swamp, and collect suitable stones with which to build a sheltering wall.\n9\tBuild a nice sheltering wall for Willem's family\tYou have gathered some things to make Willem's home a little nicer, and should go now to the north-east area of the Dunbog to set Bingo's plan in motion.\n10\tGive the toad-meat to Willem at his nest\tWillem Whisker is at his nest in the north-east corner of the Dunbog with his family.\n11\tTalk to Bingo at Willem's home in the north-east corner of the Dunbog\tBingo is at Willem Whisker's nest in the north-east corner of the Dunbog.\n12\tTalk to Bingo in the town of Avardin, in the Starkmoor\tBingo has said farewell to Willem Whisker and wants to meet you at the nearest town in the Starkmoor.\n",
[14639]="70037CFA\n1\tDefeat the goblins constructing winches ([see journal]/8)\tThe goblins must not be allowed to construct any winches in the gate-house windows, or the army will be able to raise ladders for fast entry. The wounded Rohirrim that have retreated to within the walls will be easy targets once the enemy has secured an entry point. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[14640]="7001938D\n1\tGather grapes (total: 6)\tGrapes can be found growing upon trellises in the Vineyards of Lórien. Glasnír has asked you to collect some grapes for the new wine. No banquet would be complete without fine wine with which to toast, but making a fine wine takes time. Fortunately, the Elves make particularly fine vintners, for there is no lack of time in the long lives of these fair folk.\n2\tCrush the grapes in the tub\tThe tub is in the Vineyards of Lórien. You should take the grapes to tub to be crushed.\n3\tTalk to Glasnír in the Vineyards of Lórien\tGlasnír is in the Vineyards of Lórien. You should let Glasnír know that you have collected grapes and crushed the berries as he wished.\n",
[14641]="70048CA0\n1\tDefeat plagued great-bats (total: 8)\tPlagued great-bats can be found in the Lair of the Gloom-lord. You should defeat plagued great-bats.\n2\tCompleted.\t\n",
[14642]="7002FCFC\n1\tKill a marsh-fly\tWings can be collected form marsh-flies that inhabit the Stinging Bog, on the far side of the road from Feldburg. You should collect marsh-fly wings from the Stinging Bog's large pests.\n2\tCollect marsh-fly wings (total: 7)\tWings can be collected form marsh-flies that inhabit the Stinging Bog, on the far side of the road from Feldburg. You should collect marsh-fly wings from the Stinging Bog's large pests.\n3\tBring the marsh-fly wings to Captain Agelmund\tCaptain Agelmund is at Feldburg, awaiting your return. You should bring the wings you gathered to Captain Agelmund.\n",
[14643]="70002CD3\n1\tDefeat merrevail (total: 8)\tThe bat-winged creatures who injured the Earth-kin scout are in the eastern gorges of Ram Dúath. The Earth-kin scout's request was for you to kill the vicious merrevail so that others will not be injured or worse.\n2\tTalk to Earth-kin Scout\tThe Earth-kin Scout is hidden in a valley east of Duvairë in the Ram Dúath. You should return to the Earth-kin Scout and tell him of your success against the merrevail.\n",
[14644]="70065DB5\n1\tFree captured deserters (total: 6)\030Defeat Aegollant archers (total: 8)\030Defeat Aegollant sneaks (total: 8)\tDierna has asked you to investigate Aegollant, release captured deserters, and to cull the number of bandits in the area. Aegollant is south-west of Arnach.\n2\tTalk to Dierna\tThe deserters have been freed and many bandits defeated. You should talk to Dierna. Dierna is in Arnach.\n",
[14645]="7000EAA9\n1\tDefeat Kylmä-Säri\030Defeat Tuima-kita\tThe bear, Kylmä-Säri can be found south east along the ice bay. Tuima-kita, the Peikko can be found north of Sûri-kylä.\n2\tTalk to Nôra\tNôra is at Sûri-kylä. You should speak with Nôra and tell her of your victory.\n",
[14646]="700082AA\n1\tBring the lynx-furs to Quartermaster Orgrin\030Collect lynx-furs (total: 6)\tLynx roam the hills surrounding Othrikar. Hunt the lynx that roam the hills around Othrikar in western Nan Amlug and bring them to Quartermaster Orgrin at the entrance to the dwarf-mine.\n",
[14647]="70035596\n1\tCollect pelts from snow-cats (total: 8)\tSnow-cats can be found throughout the High Knolls. You should collect pelts from snow-cats.\n2\tBring the pelts to Edhild\tEdhild can be found in the refugees' cave in the High Knolls. You should bring the pelts you gathered to Edhild to warm her.\n",
[14648]="70051B70\n1\tPlay the Winter Seasonal Instances during the Yule Festival\tWinter Seasonal Instances have arrived! Play Winter Seasonal Instances during the Yule Festival. You can access Winter Seasonal Instances from the Instance Join panel.\n2\tPlay the Winter Seasonal Instances during the Yule Festival\tWinter Seasonal Instances have arrived! Play Winter Seasonal Instances during the Yule Festival. You can access Winter Seasonal Instances from the Instance Join panel.\n",
[14649]="70017929\n1\tComplete A Warden's Second Best Ally\030Complete A Weapon of Might and Glory\tHrotha knows of a legendary warden who could teach you great lessons, but first you must be suitably outfitted.\n2\tTalk to Hrotha\tHrotha is in Ost Guruth in the Lone-lands.\n3\tTalk to Aragorn at Rivendell\tAragorn can be found in Rivendell, in one of the guest rooms of Elrond's House. Hrotha counselled you to speak with Aragorn, the Ranger also known as Strider.\n",
[14650]="7002659A\n1\tCollect coins (total: 6)\tThe coins beneath the waters are wishes that never got a chance to be fulfilled.\n2\tBring the coins to Orchalwë\tOrchalwë will want to take the coins you collected.\n",
[14651]="7005A6A2\n1\tDeliver mail to Ekhfás\030Deliver mail to Kólun\030Deliver mail to Svíthi\tThe messenger Ingvild has asked you to deliver mail to Ekhfás, Kólun, and Svíthi in Amdân. Ekhfás is at the Temámir camp, which is in the south-east corner of Amdân. Kólun at the Zhélruka camp, which is in the north-west corner. Svíthi at the Narfanghoth camp, which is near the centre of Amdân.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have delivered the mail to their rightful recipients.\n",
[14652]="70050A0E\n1\tDefeat invaders in the Withered Heath (total: 25)\tDefeat invaders in the Withered Heath\n2\tCompleted\tDefeat invaders in the Withered Heath\n",
[14653]="70050A0D\n1\tCollect sulfurous deposits (total: 10)\tGather sulfurous deposits.\n2\tCompleted\tGather sulfurous deposits.\n",
[14654]="70050A0C\n1\tDefeat Jókull\tDefeat Jókull in the Withered Heath.\n2\tTalk to Stráhek the Stout\tYou should return to to Stráhek the Stout in Skarháld and let him know of your success in the Withered Heath.\n",
[14655]="70044D5A\n1\tWait for Círgon to return home\tMílien is outside her home in the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith. Mílien is waiting for Círgon to return home. You should wait with her.\n2\tTalk to Mílien\tMílien is outside her home in the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith. Círgon has not returned home as quickly as he suggested. You should now talk to Mílien.\n3\tSearch for Círgon near the Baths of Belecthor in the Fourth Circle\tThe Baths of Belecthor can be found to the north in the Fourth Circle. Mílien has suggested you begin your search for Círgon where you last saw him - at the Baths.\n4\tTalk to Círgon\tCírgon is standing near the Baths of Belecthor in the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith. You have found Círgon, but he is in clear distress as one of his ships has been vandalised and broken.\n5\tThe puddle lead away from the Baths of Belecthor in the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith. You have attempted to comfort Círgon, and should now try to seek out the person responsible for this crime.\t\n6\tTalk to Ristagír\tThe men are standing along the wall in the Fourth Circle. You have discovered two men, one of whom is wearing clothing soaked in water. You should confront them.\n7\tTalk to Ristagír outside Mílien's home\030Talk to Mílien\tRistagír and Mílien can be found outside her home in the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith. Ristagír has asked you to meet him and his nephew at Mílien's home. You should speak to them upon your arrival.\n8\tTalk to Círgon\tCírgon can be found outside his home in the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith. You have spoken to Círgon's family and should now speak to him.\n",
[14656]="700583F5\n1\tDefeat enemies within Shakal-atrâd\tShakal-atrâd can be found in central Elderslade. You should defeat enemies within the ruins of Shakal-atrâd.\n2\tDefeat enemies within Shakal-atrâd (total: 12)\tShakal-atrâd can be found in central Elderslade. You should defeat enemies within the ruins of Shakal-atrâd.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeated many enemies at Shakal-atrâd.\n",
})
